          "start": 1103
        },
        "quote": "(c) The existing wastewater collection system shall not be used to drain water from the trench during construction of any new sanitary sewer. The connection between the new system being constructed and the existing system shall not be made until the new system has been inspected and approved. When portions of the system are approved and put into service prior to completion of the entire project, the incomplete lines shall be plugged to prevent water in the trench from entering the existing sewage collection system. (Ord. 20089 § 53, 10-17-17.)",
